     compatibility patches (Nexus Mods, mod 13207), including the RBM balance
     tables in TAOM-AIO-Compat/Fixes/RBM/Resources/;
   - the Dual Wield troop file (TAOM-AIO-Compat/Module/ModuleData/
     aio_dualwield_troops.xml), from Dual Wield - TAOM by the TAOM mod
     developers.

